1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,420
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,370
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:16,100
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,260
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,250
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,500
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,770
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,730
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,730
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:45,100
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:48,090
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,940
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,290
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,460
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,540
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,420
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,860
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,300
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,380
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,500
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,460
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:33,100
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,730
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:02:08,480 --> 00:02:10,050
Please heaven and earth,

25
00:02:09,800 --> 00:02:11,850
make it so he doesn't see us.

26
00:02:25,720 --> 00:02:27,850
Another chain of restrictions...

27
00:02:28,040 --> 00:02:29,850
Damn Six Desires brat,

28
00:02:30,320 --> 00:02:32,090
I almost fell for it.

29
00:02:39,880 --> 00:02:41,650
As expected, it's a trap.

30
00:02:41,480 --> 00:02:43,090
Remnant Rainbow Jade Sword,

31
00:02:42,840 --> 00:02:43,570
go !

32
00:02:45,320 --> 00:02:46,170
Master,

33
00:02:45,920 --> 00:02:47,210
what are you doing ?

34
00:02:46,960 --> 00:02:48,850
Just let him pass.

35
00:02:48,640 --> 00:02:50,650
If he finds us, we’re dead !

36
00:02:51,560 --> 00:02:53,010
Wait till I catch you,

37
00:02:53,280 --> 00:02:55,370
I’ll refine you to death !

38
00:03:03,640 --> 00:03:05,890
These old Devil Lords are extremely cunning.

39
00:03:06,080 --> 00:03:08,290
If he isn't the one to break the restriction,

40
00:03:08,760 --> 00:03:10,250
he'll know something's wrong.

41
00:03:10,280 --> 00:03:12,010
So that’s why...

42
00:03:11,760 --> 00:03:13,490
Master, you’re brilliant !

43
00:03:14,840 --> 00:03:18,330
A single strike of that sword broke our restrictions.

44
00:03:18,560 --> 00:03:19,410
Master,

45
00:03:19,160 --> 00:03:21,770
if only you had such a trump card too,

46
00:03:21,960 --> 00:03:24,290
we wouldn’t have to suffer through each trial like this.

47
00:03:26,800 --> 00:03:29,010
Although we’ve temporarily escaped the worst,

48
00:03:28,840 --> 00:03:32,210
these two remain a grave threat.

49
00:03:33,240 --> 00:03:35,010
On this restriction mountain,

50
00:03:35,960 --> 00:03:38,450
eliminating them isn’t impossible.

51
00:03:43,560 --> 00:03:47,570
If I didn't have to rescue you from that restriction,

52
00:03:48,160 --> 00:03:51,370
I would've reached the summit 3 months ago.

53
00:03:52,120 --> 00:03:54,730
But you are the legacy Master left me,

54
00:03:55,200 --> 00:03:57,570
how could I bear to abandon you ?

55
00:03:58,760 --> 00:04:02,730
Someone's been breaking all the restrictions I placed behind us,

56
00:04:03,200 --> 00:04:06,690
it must be that old ghost Duanmu Ji.

57
00:04:07,880 --> 00:04:08,930
Alright,

58
00:04:09,560 --> 00:04:12,250
once I have solved this final restriction,

59
00:04:12,640 --> 00:04:14,050
we'll leave.

60
00:04:17,000 --> 00:04:19,130
Such power !

61
00:04:19,160 --> 00:04:22,010
It's indeed worthy of being the last step of Restriction Mountain.

62
00:04:23,280 --> 00:04:25,570
But as long as I find this restriction's core,

63
00:04:25,960 --> 00:04:27,050
I will...

64
00:04:26,840 --> 00:04:28,290
Six Desires brat !

65
00:04:29,040 --> 00:04:30,370
I need to thank you

66
00:04:30,400 --> 00:04:32,890
for how you prepared the path for me !

67
00:04:37,400 --> 00:04:39,530
Old man, are you mad ?

68
00:04:39,320 --> 00:04:41,130
If you trigger this final restriction,

69
00:04:41,440 --> 00:04:43,410
we’ll both be annihilated.

70
00:04:44,360 --> 00:04:45,850
I'll slay you down first !

71
00:04:48,360 --> 00:04:50,690
This is something I found in a rank 5 country,

72
00:04:50,440 --> 00:04:52,330
it's my most precious artifact.

73
00:04:52,080 --> 00:04:54,050
You should be honored

74
00:04:53,840 --> 00:04:55,490
to be killed by it !

75
00:04:56,480 --> 00:04:58,170
You old freak...

76
00:04:58,240 --> 00:04:59,570
Greed !

77
00:05:12,840 --> 00:05:13,650
This is bad !

78
00:05:26,440 --> 00:05:27,770
Old ghost Duanmu,

79
00:05:27,520 --> 00:05:28,970
are you insane ?

80
00:05:28,840 --> 00:05:31,410
If I don’t refine you today,

81
00:05:31,160 --> 00:05:32,970
I swear I’m not human !

82
00:05:41,520 --> 00:05:42,770
Six Desires brat,

83
00:05:43,160 --> 00:05:46,850
I've watched you slaughter sects specialized in formations for 1000 years.

84
00:05:47,120 --> 00:05:49,290
You plunged the Sea of Devils in chaos

85
00:05:49,600 --> 00:05:52,450
just to learn how to make these worthless restrictions.

86
00:05:52,360 --> 00:05:54,250
I'll show you today

87
00:05:54,560 --> 00:05:56,650
how futile formations

88
00:05:56,440 --> 00:05:58,490
and restrictions really are !

89
00:05:59,800 --> 00:06:00,810
Ridiculous !

90
00:06:01,240 --> 00:06:03,490
You used that Core Formation brat as a decoy,

91
00:06:03,720 --> 00:06:06,650
did you ever plan to let him survive past the third trial ?

92
00:06:07,440 --> 00:06:09,690
I immersed myself in the Dao of restrictions

93
00:06:09,800 --> 00:06:12,050
but you, an unscrupulous old lunatic,

94
00:06:12,560 --> 00:06:14,250
dares to lecture me !?

95
00:06:16,040 --> 00:06:17,370
You talk too much !

96
00:06:22,440 --> 00:06:25,170
When you set those vicious chain restrictions,

97
00:06:25,280 --> 00:06:27,570
you never thought this day would come, did you ?

98
00:06:27,720 --> 00:06:29,410
Now die !

99
00:06:34,560 --> 00:06:36,410
What are you talking about ?

100
00:06:36,280 --> 00:06:38,130
Chain restrictions ?

101
00:06:38,240 --> 00:06:39,410
What ?

102
00:06:39,480 --> 00:06:41,290
Do you think you can fool me ?

103
00:06:41,880 --> 00:06:43,250
Besides you,

104
00:06:43,320 --> 00:06:45,530
who could have done it ?

105
00:06:48,640 --> 00:06:49,770
Brother Duanmu,

106
00:06:49,920 --> 00:06:51,810
I believe this is a misunderstanding.

107
00:06:51,560 --> 00:06:53,290
I never set chain restrictions.

108
00:06:54,040 --> 00:06:56,050
I'll make a Devil Hearth Oath.

109
00:06:56,160 --> 00:06:57,890
Besides the two of us,

110
00:06:57,640 --> 00:06:59,610
there is someone else on this mountain.

111
00:06:59,520 --> 00:07:01,530
That person didn't climb to the top yet,

112
00:07:01,440 --> 00:07:03,170
they must be hiding somewhere

113
00:07:03,360 --> 00:07:05,210
and watching us fight.

114
00:07:06,960 --> 00:07:09,290
Could it be Hunchback Meng ?

115
00:07:10,640 --> 00:07:11,810
Whoever it is,

116
00:07:12,040 --> 00:07:13,970
we should leave quickly.

117
00:07:15,200 --> 00:07:16,290
Too late !

118
00:07:32,000 --> 00:07:33,050
It’s him !

119
00:07:33,120 --> 00:07:34,690
The Core Formation brat

120
00:07:34,880 --> 00:07:37,090
actually triggered the final restriction ?

121
00:07:37,560 --> 00:07:39,770
Oh no... He’s gone mad, completely mad !

122
00:07:39,880 --> 00:07:43,690
This fiend dared to attack two Soul Formation cultivators.

123
00:08:12,360 --> 00:08:13,490
I will succeed

124
00:08:13,800 --> 00:08:15,170
in this second trial !

125
00:08:23,080 --> 00:08:24,210
Anger !

126
00:08:37,520 --> 00:08:39,330
Master, look down the mountain.

127
00:08:49,720 --> 00:08:50,890
This is bad !

128
00:08:58,920 --> 00:09:01,930
What... what kind of restriction is this ?

129
00:09:17,880 --> 00:09:20,170
Brother Duanmu, if you hold back any longer

130
00:09:19,920 --> 00:09:22,130
I fear neither of us will pass this second trial.

131
00:09:21,920 --> 00:09:23,170
I know,

132
00:09:23,200 --> 00:09:24,970
even if it costs us some cultivation

133
00:09:24,720 --> 00:09:26,090
we must charge through.

134
00:09:31,560 --> 00:09:33,170
Core Formation brat,

135
00:09:32,920 --> 00:09:35,130
may you die a miserable death !

136
00:09:47,480 --> 00:09:48,970
All in one...

137
00:09:49,480 --> 00:09:51,010
One is all....

138
00:09:51,200 --> 00:09:54,170
This restriction mountain is one single giant restriction.

139
00:09:58,800 --> 00:09:59,850
Pick it up.

140
00:10:06,160 --> 00:10:09,490
This thing has no trace of spiritual energy.

141
00:10:09,680 --> 00:10:11,410
It’s probably already useless.

142
00:10:12,920 --> 00:10:15,250
I can't probe it with my Divine Sense ?

143
00:10:21,920 --> 00:10:22,970
Master,

144
00:10:23,080 --> 00:10:26,410
you’re the only person left on this restriction mountain.

145
00:10:26,360 --> 00:10:28,210
Stop dawdling,

146
00:10:28,280 --> 00:10:29,810
let’s leave quickly.

147
00:10:29,880 --> 00:10:33,410
The final restriction is something even Soul Formation cultivators can’t withstand.

148
00:10:33,160 --> 00:10:34,770
I can’t force my way through it.

149
00:10:34,520 --> 00:10:36,490
Besides, now that I’m the only one left,

150
00:10:36,240 --> 00:10:38,090
I can take my time to study it.

151
00:10:49,840 --> 00:10:51,690
I will sleep for a while then...

152
00:11:09,720 --> 00:11:11,290
Are you done now ?

153
00:11:11,320 --> 00:11:12,890
Are you done now ?

154
00:11:17,880 --> 00:11:20,210
3 years later

155
00:11:24,080 --> 00:11:25,810
What’s happening ?

156
00:11:33,040 --> 00:11:35,890
The first chains with the second, the second with the third,

157
00:11:35,640 --> 00:11:37,210
all the restrictions are linked !

158
00:11:53,560 --> 00:11:54,930
He solved it ?

159
00:11:54,680 --> 00:11:57,650
Finally, we can leave this cursed place !

160
00:12:04,040 --> 00:12:05,290
I can’t move,

161
00:12:05,040 --> 00:12:06,930
we’re doomed !

162
00:12:09,120 --> 00:12:11,130
What’s going on ?

163
00:12:10,880 --> 00:12:13,610
I clearly solved all the restrictions.

164
00:12:13,360 --> 00:12:14,450
This...

165
00:12:24,360 --> 00:12:27,010
My name is Tu Si.

166
00:12:27,840 --> 00:12:31,690
You have solved all restrictions of Restriction Mountain.

167
00:12:32,040 --> 00:12:37,210
You are the fourth Enlightened of Restriction Mountain.

168
00:12:36,960 --> 00:12:40,250
I'm here to give you the method to refine a Restriction Flag.

169
00:12:36,960 --> 00:12:40,330
Tu Si
8-stars Ancient God

170
00:12:40,560 --> 00:12:43,410
If you can enter my Sea of Consciousness

171
00:12:43,960 --> 00:12:46,450
as an Enlightened,

172
00:12:46,200 --> 00:12:49,930
you may receive a part of my memories of restrictions.

173
00:12:50,360 --> 00:12:52,370
Each Enlightened

174
00:12:52,120 --> 00:12:57,050
can also find a piece of Void Ink Stone in my Sea of Consciousness.

175
00:12:57,880 --> 00:13:02,010
This Void Ink Stone isn’t produced on any planet

176
00:13:02,160 --> 00:13:05,930
but only comes from the starry sky.

177
00:13:06,120 --> 00:13:09,610
It's the essential material for crafting a Restriction Flag.

178
00:13:10,240 --> 00:13:18,250
After you engrave 999 999 restrictions on that flag,

179
00:13:18,000 --> 00:13:21,130
it will become a true Restriction Flag.

180
00:14:02,520 --> 00:14:03,570
Explore it.

181
00:14:04,960 --> 00:14:08,090
The moment I come out, he always makes me do the hard work...

182
00:14:11,760 --> 00:14:14,210
Master, everything inside the pagoda is safe.

183
00:14:25,800 --> 00:14:29,770
Nothing here can catch my eye. I'm very disappointed.
The Flood Dragon in the first trial was too weak.
It seems that this is all the Land of the Ancient God has to offer.

184
00:14:26,240 --> 00:14:28,130
It’s him again !

185
00:14:27,880 --> 00:14:29,530
Such an arrogant tone...

186
00:14:29,880 --> 00:14:31,890
It seems these perilous trials

187
00:14:32,280 --> 00:14:34,170
were effortless for him.

188
00:14:52,240 --> 00:14:55,450
It looks like the previous Enlightened

189
00:14:55,840 --> 00:14:57,130
took everything.

190
00:14:59,400 --> 00:15:01,410
All that work for nothing.

191
00:15:16,240 --> 00:15:18,090
They left something for us !

192
00:15:19,160 --> 00:15:20,530
If you don’t want to die,

193
00:15:20,280 --> 00:15:21,370
don’t touch it.

194
00:15:24,000 --> 00:15:25,730
The reason this bag is still here

195
00:15:26,280 --> 00:15:28,210
must be because of that restriction.

196
00:15:35,840 --> 00:15:37,490
This restriction is too complex.

197
00:15:39,040 --> 00:15:41,650
My current cultivation isn’t enough to solve it.

198
00:15:42,000 --> 00:15:45,330
It’ll take many years before I can open it.

199
00:15:50,200 --> 00:15:51,250
Go in.

200
00:15:52,040 --> 00:15:53,690
You're only giving me this little ?

201
00:15:53,640 --> 00:15:55,650
Who knows what awaits me this time ?

202
00:16:03,160 --> 00:16:05,010
He knows the Death Spell.

203
00:16:05,480 --> 00:16:06,570
Little brat,

204
00:16:07,240 --> 00:16:09,730
if you can really help us in the third trial,

205
00:16:10,360 --> 00:16:13,290
I wouldn't mind keeping you by my side forever.

206
00:16:13,800 --> 00:16:15,090
This gate

207
00:16:15,440 --> 00:16:18,330
must lead to the third trial, the Six Desires Devil Lord and company.

208
00:16:20,040 --> 00:16:21,970
With my mere Core Formation cultivation

209
00:16:21,760 --> 00:16:23,730
I have a very low chance

210
00:16:23,720 --> 00:16:25,810
of passing it smoothly.

211
00:16:45,320 --> 00:16:46,410
This place is...

212
00:16:45,120 --> 00:16:48,610
Nirvana Space
Land of the Ancient God
Third trial

213
00:16:49,160 --> 00:16:50,650
another Foreign Battlefield ?

214
00:17:08,920 --> 00:17:09,810
I see...

215
00:17:10,880 --> 00:17:13,690
That's what the third trial is.

216
00:17:17,520 --> 00:19:40,210
In the donghua, Wang Lin finds a bag of holding at the end of the second trial. But the story is very different in the novel.

When Wang Lin was paying respects to Founder Chen Chong after learning the Divine Path in the War God Shrine, he checked out all the chambers and noticed that something was wrong. In one of the chambers he found a corpse that wasn't sitting down in mediation but floating. That corpse seemed to be absorbing the death energy of all the other corpses and showed signs of being alive. Wang Lin deduced that this person was not an Ancestor of the War God Shrine but an outsider that was cultivating here in secret. That person's bag of holding looked very different from all the other bags Wang Lin saw before so he decided to steal it. The bag was also sealed the same way it is in the donghua so he wasn't able to open it.

The donghua comes up with another explanation that leads to the same consequences. I'll put another note when that becomes relevant.

217
00:17:46,430 --> 00:17:53,560
Count the specks of time

218
00:17:50,310 --> 00:17:53,560
floating down gently.

219
00:17:53,670 --> 00:17:59,800
The carving knife in your hands etches out destiny.

220
00:18:00,670 --> 00:18:07,320
Forever lock away the scars

221
00:18:04,470 --> 00:18:07,320
of this mortal life.

222
00:18:07,330 --> 00:18:13,840
This fleeting youth is a thing of the past.

223
00:18:14,230 --> 00:18:21,560
The flying bird could not escape the twilight

224
00:18:16,910 --> 00:18:21,560
that fills the sky with a myriad of colors.

225
00:18:21,390 --> 00:18:28,720
The night-blooming flower cannot drink

226
00:18:23,430 --> 00:18:28,720
the crystalization of the golden wind and the jade dew.

227
00:18:28,910 --> 00:18:31,240
I will ask the heavens who exactly

228
00:18:30,990 --> 00:18:36,000
sliced open this world

229
00:18:32,390 --> 00:18:36,000
to let the rain fall in.

230
00:18:35,750 --> 00:18:38,000
I will refine the world

231
00:18:37,830 --> 00:18:40,520
to make our palm lines say

232
00:18:40,470 --> 00:18:42,880
that we will live forever.

233
00:18:42,630 --> 00:18:45,800
Walking off the beaten path

234
00:18:45,550 --> 00:18:48,880
through heaven and earth.

235
00:18:49,910 --> 00:18:55,840
Before returning to dust,

236
00:18:51,830 --> 00:18:55,840
I will refine this mortal body.

237
00:18:57,110 --> 00:19:04,720
The left shore is the joyous laughter

238
00:19:00,990 --> 00:19:04,720
that can brighten up a thousand years of sadness.

239
00:19:04,470 --> 00:19:11,320
The right shore is an eternal silence

240
00:19:06,070 --> 00:19:11,320
lingering under the candlelight.

241
00:19:11,270 --> 00:19:14,200
To overturn this fate,

242
00:19:13,950 --> 00:19:18,560
I will walk against the heavens.

243
00:19:18,750 --> 00:19:25,720
I will even gather the clouds

244
00:19:21,270 --> 00:19:25,720
to illuminate the sky for you.

245
00:19:25,870 --> 00:19:29,960
All this sadness was not meaningless.

246
00:19:29,710 --> 00:19:33,280
How many lives and deaths
have passed in the blink of an eye ?

247
00:19:33,030 --> 00:19:39,080
I vow to break

248
00:19:35,270 --> 00:19:39,080
this chess game of fate.

249
00:19:40,150 --> 00:19:50,040
I vow to break

250
00:19:41,950 --> 00:19:50,040
this chess game of fate.
